   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **All Time Low** (1 review): Reviewer singles out this song as a standout of the night [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Hearbeat of America**: back after 66 archived shows (395 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [4]\n- **Texas Gales**: back after 111 archived shows (596 days); rare: 4 archived performances [4]\n- **A Face in the Crowd**: back after 64 archived shows (392 days); rare: 4 archived performances [4]\n- **Old Swinging Bridge**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [4]\n- **Sharecropper's Son**: back after 121 archived shows (640 days) [4]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Harbor of Love [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2023-12-09.4mic.flac24** (recommended): source not stated; 26 songs; 152 min; rated 5/5 by 2 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer, aged 50, chatted with a fan at the show who had seen Old & In the Way [3]\n- FOH engineer Andy Lytle made room for the taper to set up [1]\n- Reviewer ranks it as the best show they attended during 2023 [2]\n- Reviewer has seen the band six times; a fellow attendee who saw Old & In the Way seven times said this surpasses them [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2023-12-09.4mic.flac24**: taped by Peter Del Savio; transferred by Peter Del Savio; source: (4 mic mix) Neumann KM185's + Telefunken TF11's -> Sound Devices MixPre-6 (24/48) [1]. Also: Transferred using Audacity for mixing, trimming and fades, then CDWave and FLAC; recorded and transferred by Peter Del Savio [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings CFG Bank Arena - Baltimore, MD - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/show/cfg-arena-baltimore-md/) [5]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings 2023-12-09 CFG Arena Baltimore Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/2023-12-09-cfg-arena-baltimore-regular/) [6]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings 2023-12-09 CFG Arena Baltimore Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/2023-12-09-cfg-arena-baltimore-regular/) [7]\n- Poster by panetory.com: [Billy Strings Cfg Bank Arena Baltimore Md December 9 2023 Poster 2026](https://panetory.com/billy-strings-cfg-bank-arena-baltimore-md-december-9-2023-poster) [8]\n- Poster by panetory.com: [Billy Strings Cfg Bank Arena Baltimore Md December 9 2023 Poster 2026](https://panetory.com/billy-strings-cfg-bank-arena-baltimore-md-december-9-2023-poster) [9]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings 2023-12-09 CFG Arena Baltimore Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/2023-12-09-cfg-arena-baltimore-regular/) [10]",
